{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "03cbf3d6ebae26d7b204c6526eeee57c637638eba8e632af78b762c977bcf4c9", "ja": "兄ちゃん聞いて聞いてー。亜美、やっぱ、\n一日に一個は伝説を作ろうと思ってるんだよね～。", "zh": "大哥哥，你听亚美说～亚美还是觉得，\n果然应该一天创造一个传说才对～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0d65145911447027aabe39313f0ca44767efe4ea2eae016d50adcf79b307c4b7", "ja": "そうか。何がやっぱりなのか、わからないけど……\n人に迷惑はかけないようにな？", "zh": "这样啊，虽然我不是很懂哪里应该了……\n但你可别给人添麻烦喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "3263da7dc84212b8df102ef7e14eff3ef3edc01623ee79d81bd693ddd2f8834b", "ja": "かけるわけないっしょ？　亜美を誰だと思ってんの？\n真美じゃないんだよ！？", "zh": "亚美怎么可能会给人添麻烦？你把亚美当成谁了？\n人家又不是真美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a9f64e1a1cdfcab21709fe4c8a3d660af3defe80490f02e2938d92afa909253a", "ja": "いや、それは知ってるけど。", "zh": "呃，我知道啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "8c4bce6dc708e11d2c06f303bd0c92127b22544daf417587f9eecad76f9ffd26", "ja": "今までの伝説だって、めっちゃいい子っぽいの\nばっかなんだかんね！　たとえば～。", "zh": "至今为止创造的传说，也都像超级乖宝宝才会做的！\n比如说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "aa5fa00c57ddce47b2cc3c5ff27922cba0b2a5fc3ef40c974f327bc5aed2b286", "ja": "一日中、ネコのあとをつけた伝説とか、\nいっぺんにおにぎり4つ食べた伝説とか♪", "zh": "跟在猫咪后头一整天的传说，\n或是一口气吃掉四个饭团的传说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "456ee2bd27637af01557ef86a2f1bc31c4466048b4d0edb36b685698e8f44542", "ja": "へえ。なかなか面白い伝説じゃないか。", "zh": "哦，这些传说还挺有趣的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "480db0c4de28fe206bdc6b55057f76bdfa4e470d11c10e80c5b37f3cc8b74a7c", "ja": "でしょでしょ！？　\n亜美、伝説の才能ありまくりかもしんないね！", "zh": "对吧对吧！？\n亚美搞不好超级有创造传说的天赋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "35d461ec76f6b2cddf4f840bdd05b3497121669b74c8c6ca88b094f23c96537a", "ja": "でね？　今日はどうしよっかな～って考えてるん\nだけど……兄ちゃんは、どんなのがいいと思う？", "zh": "然后呀，亚美在想今天要做些什么……\n大哥哥觉得要做什么好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "f643a8da2885003f759cb4c3bd337cd2d15970f5567966855b458e5803ac20aa", "ja": "亜美、今日はなんか思いつかなくってさ～。\nちょびっとお困り中なんだよー。", "zh": "今天，亚美真的想不到要做什么～\n现在正有点伤脑筋呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5c245b19b899f66b93d16bd0684be2649b32f6acf01ee226bf28460e20d36133", "ja": "なるほど……。じゃあ、ここはひとつ、歴史に残る\nようなすごい伝説にチャレンジしてみないか？", "zh": "这样啊……那么，你要不要试试看挑战那种，\n可以名留青史的伟大传说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "54e231d3873608ee202561d926367966f7c02b45d275a943db42fab5d908f421", "ja": "……なに言ってんの、兄ちゃん？\nそんなのカンタンにできるわけないっしょ？", "zh": "……大哥哥，你在胡说什么啊？\n那种事情哪是随便就办得到的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "6c51112d3e0b9999dab56313352e1bae7cd354fcf335fa427870899e02386b1f", "ja": "亜美にもカンタンにできて、ちょびっとすごいっぽい、\nそーゆーお手軽な伝説がいいの～！", "zh": "亚美想要的是可以轻松达成，但又让人感觉有点厉害，\n那种比较平易近人的传说啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8a9f1ea970369d167930f0c5e8ecd1cf0b516cecedd71821f6fed7fa3e0ff37d", "ja": "そ、そうか。意外と現実的なんだな……。でも、\n今の亜美なら、すごい伝説でもできるかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "这、这样啊，还真是意外地务实……不过，\n如果是现在的亚美，说不定也能创造很厉害的传说喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "553a0d6e7c442afae48b14ce6b62832bb4eddabec5a678136daac4ff902f2b80", "ja": "たとえば、この前のレジェンドデイズのライブは、\nまさに伝説級だったじゃないか。", "zh": "比方说，前阵子的『Legend Days』演唱会，\n那不就是传说等级的演出吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "a9ab3cb88943c6613ac44b95e99987b3fbc720669ff54113dc095f3f7836bee8", "ja": "あっ、そうだね！　あれは亜美の国の歴史に残る、\nホントにレジェンドっぽい伝説だったよ～。", "zh": "啊，对耶！那是在亚美的国家写下历史，\n真的有如Legend的传说呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "d5e55f294ef360e685321fdc9693b8589cae4a5bd59228e9ef5253f698b11271", "ja": "そっか、ああいうのかー。うんうん、いいかも！\n亜美も、またああいう伝説したい！", "zh": "原来是在讲那种呀～嗯嗯，好像不错！\n亚美也想再创造出那种传说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b62667563286f69a764bddaf6cddecfa0e3c58fe4785f84faf779db5d67ef5c", "ja": "もっとメチャスゴなライブ、考えてみよっかな～。\nファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃんが喜んでくれそうなやつ！", "zh": "那就再来构思超厉害的演唱会好了～\n会让粉丝的大哥哥、大姊姊们高兴的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1018_p", "source_sha256": "788f0e27f5025e5faf13809695debff032503267157eb995504c20aedf5adc00", "ja": "おっ、やる気出てきたみたいだな。\n俺も、亜美が作る伝説のライブ、もっと見てみたいよ。", "zh": "哦，看来你是拿出干劲啰。\n我也想再多看一些亚美创造的传说级演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "0556a6cd7eca7b7b5504fee24ab01cc230cef8725a65a09aa8c3eb4620fdb5df", "ja": "わかったー！　そんじゃ亜美、真美と考えてみるね！\nだから、また遊びに連れてってね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "亚美知道了～！亚美会跟真美一起想想看！\n所以大哥哥，你要再带我们出去玩喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0053_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c2a9075ae935c6ec417d1672b30e61bbec204caf5cdfe7ce7da1da1d5d519cce", "ja": "（レジェンドデイズ公演の成功も、亜美の自由な発想が\nあればこそだった。これからも、大切にしないとな！）", "zh": "（『Legend Days』公演得以成功，也是归功于\n亚美灵活的思考。今后也要好好重视她的想法才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
